stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle : Power On / Reset
    Idle --> Accumulate : insert(coin)
    Accumulate --> Accumulate : insert(coin)
    Accumulate --> Vend : select(item) [amount is enough for i]
    Vend --> ReturnChange : [amount > 0]
    Vend --> Idle : [amount = 0]
    ReturnChange --> Idle : change returned
    Idle --> [*] : Power Off
